11	 * {@link MembershipLevel membership level} among the owners already sharing its
12	 * {@link HouseholdNormalizer#id(String, String) household id} (same last name and postcode). Runs
13	 * before {@link SaveOwner}, so the count is taken over existing household members only; with no
14	 * existing member no cap applies and the ceiling stays {@code null}. The stored cap is applied when
15	 * the owner's level is read (see {@code OwnerMapper#membershipLevel}). Mutates the built
16	 * {@link Owner} in place.
